msgid "## Inference {: #quick-start-inference }"
msgstr "## 推理 {: #quick-start-inference }"

msgid ""
"The following sections provide offline inference and online serving "
"examples. Choose the method you need to get started."
msgstr "以下章节提供离线推理和在线服务示例。请根据您的需要选择相应的方法开始使用。"

msgid "??? tip \"If Hugging Face access is restricted\""
msgstr "??? tip \"如果Hugging Face访问受限\""

msgid ""
"If your environment cannot reliably access Hugging Face, model downloads may"
" fail due to connection timeouts, DNS errors, or other network issues. You "
"can switch to ModelScope:"
msgstr ""
"如果您的环境无法稳定访问Hugging Face，模型下载可能会因连接超时、DNS错误或其他网络问题而失败。您可以切换到ModelScope："

msgid ""
"If the model has already been downloaded locally, replace the model ID in "
"the examples below with the local directory. You do not need to set this "
"environment variable."
msgstr "如果模型已下载到本地，请将以下示例中的模型ID替换为本地目录。您无需设置此环境变量。"

